; M4b R6B v0.0.8 - one synchronized swap candidate
; Runtime HUNK is generated by tools/build_m4b_r6b.py.
; Target: AMOS Pro 365, 68020+, AGA, Intuition V39+.
;
; Shared extension state remains 36 bytes:
;   +0  Screen*
;   +4  IntuitionBase
;   +8  GfxBase
;   +12 width
;   +16 height
;   +20 colors
;   +24 modeID
;   +28 depth
;   +32 DBState*
;
; DBState R6B (24 bytes, MEMF_PUBLIC|MEMF_CLEAR):
;   +0  ScreenBuffer* original
;   +4  ScreenBuffer* alternate
;   +8  current front index
;   +12 MsgPort* Safe
;   +16 MsgPort* Disp
;   +20 reserved
;
; R6B rules:
; - preserve A3; functions return in D3;
; - publish DBState only after both ScreenBuffers, both ports and DBufInfo ReplyPorts are initialized;
; - each ScreenBuffer gets dedicated Safe/Disp ReplyPorts;
; - Aga Swap executes exactly one ChangeScreenBuffer attempt;
; - WaitBlit precedes ChangeScreenBuffer;
; - front index changes only after ChangeScreenBuffer succeeds;
; - success waits for one Safe reply and one Disp reply with WaitPort/GetMsg;
; - reply messages are consumed, never ReplyMsg'd;
; - no unbounded retry loop;
; - cleanup frees ScreenBuffers before deleting ports and FreeVec;
; - Aga Back Fill remains a no-op.
